	"page_from_jassim": "Jassim takes a folded page from his pocket. \"Your grandfather asked me to give you this once you sold your first crop.\"",
	"page_1": "\"If you are reading this, the farm is yours. Plant something. Then go and meet the village.\" (Saad)",
	"chapter_well": "\"He left pages like this with the people he trusted,\" says Jassim. \"Go and see the elder in the village. He has the next one.\"",
	"page_from_elder": "The elder takes a page from his robe. \"Your grandfather left this with me.\"",
	"page_2": "\"I dug this well with my own hands. When the water stops, the village forgets how to gather.\" (Saad)",
	"chapter_grove": "The merchant sighs. \"The old palms were sold in a hard year. Plant the grove again, and the orchard will live.\"",
	"page_from_merchant": "The merchant smiles and hands you a page. \"Saad never sold his palms.\"",
	"page_3": "\"I lent dates to anyone in need. Many still owe me a kindness. Let them pay it to my grandson instead.\" (Saad)",
	"chapter_market": "The carpenter rolls up his sleeves. \"Bring wood and stone, and I'll build the market stalls again.\"",
	"page_from_carpenter": "The carpenter unrolls an old sketch. \"Your grandfather drew this for me years ago.\"",
	"page_4": "\"A diwaniya for the whole village, where every door is open. I never finished it. Maybe you will.\" (Saad)",
	"chapter_dock": "The fisherman looks at the sea. \"The dhows stopped going out when the old dock broke. Help me fix it.\"",
	"page_from_fisherman": "The fisherman gives you a page, wet at one corner. \"He kept it in his diving bag.\"",
	"page_5": "\"I dived once and found one pearl. I gave it to the village to buy our first boat. The sea gives to those who share.\" (Saad)",
	"chapter_diwaniya": "Everyone gathers around the carpenter's sketch. It is time to build Saad's diwaniya together.",
	"page_from_chest": "That night, in grandfather's chest at home, you find one last page.",
	"page_6": "\"A farm feeds a family. A village feeds a heart. Thank you for finishing what I started.\" (Saad)",
